OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteer celebrates 50 years with
OL,4,Atalking newspaper
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who has volunteered for the
OL,7,Fsame charity for 50 years said it's
OL,8,F"been the joy" of her life.
OL,10,FJanet Graham started recording for the
OL,11,FRedditch and Bromsgrove Talking
OL,12,FNewspaper in October 1976 and still
OL,13,Fhelps with the weekly production.
OL,15,FThe service is celebrating five decades
OL,16,Fof operation on 4 October this year,
OL,17,Fwith Graham due to receive a long
OL,18,Fservice certificate from the Talking
OL,19,FNewspaper Federation.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
