OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteer celebrates 50 years with
OL,4,Atalking newspaper
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Both my mother and mother-in-law were
OL,7,Fregistered blind so, it's sort of close
OL,8,Fto my heart really... it's been an
OL,9,Fhonour and a priviledge... part of my
OL,10,Flife, and my family's life", she said.
